Subject: [PATCH] unix: install the programs built by do_compile

The recipe builds the programs with the flags generated by the generic
target. The separate install invocation lacks those flags. Do not relink
the programs with the Makefile defaults during do_install.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenEmbedded recipe integration]
---
 unix/Makefile | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/unix/Makefile b/unix/Makefile
--- a/unix/Makefile
+++ b/unix/Makefile
@@ -157,5 +157,5 @@
 # install
-install:        $(ZIPS)
+install:
 	-$(INSTALL_D) $(BINDIR)
 	$(INSTALL_PROGRAM) $(ZIPS) $(BINDIR)
 	-cd $(BINDIR); $(CHMOD) $(BINFLAGS) $(ZIPS)
